   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Siobhan and Tristan are trying to decide where they will have dinner. Siobhan wants to go to Antoine’s, Burger Hut, or the Chowder Palace. Tristan prefers Burger Hut, Chowder Palace, or Duck Duck Taco. They will flip a coin to decide who gets to choose, then that person selects a restaurant from their list. Use an appropriate method to identify the sample space of possible outcomes, which include the person who chooses and the restaurant.",
